"192809":{"averageScore":84,"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/192809-GYqoYK9Sfhkk.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#43a1f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx192809-wRlqABGsx2Qs.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx192809-wRlqABGsx2Qs.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx192809-wRlqABGsx2Qs.jpg"},"description":"<i>\"The strongest duo—A youth they can never return to.\"</i><br><br>\n\nRecompilation film of <i>Jujutsu Kaisen 2nd Season's</i> \"Kaigyoku・Gyokusetsu\" (Hidden Inventory / Premature Death) arc (episodes 1-5 re-edited) with new footage showing glimpses of school memories accompanied by an acoustic version of \"Ao no Sumika\" (Where Our Blue Is) by Tatsuya Kitani.\n\n<br><br>\nBefore they were enemies, Satoru Gojo and Suguru Geto were high school classmates and friends. The two most powerful sorcerers are tasked with protecting Riko Amanai, a student who has been designated to be sacrificed as the Star Plasma Vessel, until she can fulfill her duty. Pursued by a religious cult and other curse users, they are the only sorcerers capable of carrying out such a difficult task – but this mission will set their destinies, and challenge the two sorcerers in ways unimaginable.<br><br>\n\n(Source: GKIDS)","duration":111,"endDate":{"day":30,"month":5,"year":2025},"episodes":1,"favourites":799,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Drama","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#呪術廻戦 #懐玉・玉折","id":192809,"idMal":59654,"isAdult":false,"isLicensed":true,"meanScore":84,"popularity":31012,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2025,"source":"MANGA","startDate":{"day":30,"month":5,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","studios":[{"id":569,"name":"MAPPA"}],"synonyms":["JJK Movie","JUJUTSU KAISEN - Inventário Oculto / Morte Prematura - O Filme"],"tags":[{"id":321,"isMediaSpoiler":false,"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":100},{"id